This project derives its visual clock encoding and circle-detection method from
the Intel RealSense librealsense rs-latency-tool sample:
https://github.com/realsenseai/librealsense/tree/master/wrappers/opencv/latency-tool

The upstream sample is Copyright(c) 2017 Intel Corporation and is distributed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Changes include command-line device and
profile selection, latest-frame callback capture, robust timestamp handling,
CSV output, 180-degree rotation, full-frame circle-row selection, and Ubuntu
Wayland/XWayland window behavior.
